  "scope": "hardware_projection",
  "notes": "Manually authored oracle for the explicit lowering: relaxed accesses become ordinary architecture loads/stores; seq_cst fence becomes x86 MFENCE or RISC-V FENCE RW,RW. Both fences must survive slicing. This tests the chosen architecture projection, not an arbitrary C compiler or a full C11 axiomatic model."
